# bb-only: the keyboard's debounce delay at $0097-$0098 (docs/clean-room-basic.md section 11, item 35: [OWNER-SPEC]
# so far) read as the first line typed after the clean start, and again after a few lines; then the cursor's blink
# at an idle prompt: a picture every second field for 200 fields (100 pictures; the harness's #screenshot runs one
# field, a #frames 1 the other), nothing typed, so each picture's hash shows whether the cursor is lit and the
# transitions give the period in fields. Low RAM is PEEKed only at the literal addresses 151 and 152 (bb-only,
# reviewed by hand). Syntax [UM]; the values and the blink [BB].
PRINT PEEK(151);PEEK(152)
PRINT 1
PRINT 2
PRINT PEEK(151);PEEK(152)
